  triage:title "Sprint doc AC7 says the pump logs one warning per tick without a TaskStore, contradicting Property 8's transition-only wording in the same document" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r2, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T14:22Z) at head fbee74ba8a9abf0b3e04b01bc157b8a65f194119. req-qa (AX5-QA2-N04): docs/plans/phase-ax/sprint-AX.5-task-reminder-cycle.md:283-284 (AC7: 'logs one warning per tick') contradicts docs/plans/phase-ax/sprint-AX.5-task-reminder-cycle.md:129 (Property 8: 'The warning is logged on transition only'). The implementation follows Property 8. Ruling: Property 8 is the contract (avoids log spam); fix AC7's wording to 'logs the task-store-unavailable warning on transition only' and keep the AC7 test aligned." ;
